---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">About the Firm</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy mb-8">Decades of Criminal Defence Experience</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>Rajendra Criminal Law Firm is a specialised criminal defence practice based in Chennai. Our advocates appear regularly before the Madras High Court, Sessions Courts, and Magistrate Courts across the city.</p>
      <p>The firm handles the full spectrum of criminal matters — from urgent bail applications and anticipatory bail to complex trials involving NDPS, cyber offences, financial fraud, and serious charges under the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita.</p>
      <p>We prioritise early intervention. Criminal cases move quickly; prompt legal advice often determines the outcome of bail, investigation, and trial strategy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <img src="/court.webp" alt="Madras High Court" class="w-full rounded-sm shadow-md" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mb-3">Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/80">Thorough case preparation, careful scrutiny of evidence and procedure, and clear communication with clients at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mb-3">Availability</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/80">Criminal emergencies do not follow office hours. Our team provides round-the-clock assistance for arrests and urgent applications.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
